```text
Requirements
     ↓
Planning
     ↓
Design
     ↓
Development
     ↓
Testing
     ↓
Review
     ↓
Feedback
     │
     └──────► Next Iteration
```

|        Stage        | Description                           |
| :-----------------: | :------------------------------------ |
| 📋 **Requirements** | Understand what needs to be developed |
