# 🧠 What are Agile Methodologies?

Agile methodologies are frameworks and approaches used to apply Agile values and principles.

| Methodology                        | Main Focus                                 |
| :--------------------------------- | :----------------------------------------- |
| 🔄 **Scrum**                       | Development using short Sprints            |
